<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>APRASRANET</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/img/loge.png">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600&display=swap');
        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50">

<header>
    <nav class="fixed top-0 w-full bg-white bg-opacity-90 shadow-md px-6 py-4 transition-all duration-300" id="navbar">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center max-w-screen-xl mx-auto">
            <a href="/" class="flex items-center">
                <img src="/img/loge.png" class="w-8 h-8" alt="Logo" /> <!-- Tamaño reducido -->
                <span class="ml-2 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 hidden md:block"> <!-- Tamaño de texto reducido -->
                    APRASRA<span class="text-primary-600">NET</span>
                </span>
            </a>
            
            <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center space-x-6">
                <a href="/" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-[#8a38a1] transition font-medium">Inicio</a>
                <a href="#" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-[#8a38a1] transition font-medium">Acerca de</a>
                <a href="#" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-[#8a38a1] transition font-medium">Servicios</a>
                <a href="#" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-[#8a38a1] transition font-medium">Portafolio</a>
                <a href="#" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-[#8a38a1] transition font-medium">Habilidades</a>
                <a href="#" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-[#8a38a1] transition font-medium">Contacto</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>
</header>

<main class="pt-24">
    <section class="text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-[#8a38a1] to-[#722c85] text-white py-24 rounded-b-3xl shadow-lg">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold animate-fade-in">Nuestros Servicios</h1>
        <p class="text-lg mt-4 animate-fade-in delay-200">Soluciones digitales innovadoras para hacer crecer tu negocio</p>
    </section>
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto bg-white shadow-2xl rounded-3xl p-12 mt-[-50px] relative border border-gray-200">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center text-gray-800 mb-8">¿Qué ofrecemos?</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
            <!-- Tarjetas de servicios -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-2 text-center hover:scale-105">
                <img src="/img/DWeb.webp" alt="Desarrollo Web" class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-md">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-4 text-gray-800">Desarrollo Web</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">Diseñamos sitios web modernos, funcionales y optimizados para SEO.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-2 text-center hover:scale-105">
                <img src="/img/app.webp" alt="Aplicaciones Móviles" class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-md">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-4 text-gray-800">Aplicaciones Móviles</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">Desarrollamos apps para Android e iOS con la mejor experiencia de usuario.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-2 text-center hover:scale-105">
                <img src="/img/ux.webp" alt="Diseño UI/UX" class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-md">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-4 text-gray-800">Diseño UI/UX</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">Creamos experiencias visuales atractivas e intuitivas para tus usuarios.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-2 text-center hover:scale-105">
                <img src="/img/gdt.webp" alt="Desarrollo de Juegos" class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-md">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-4 text-gray-800">Desarrollo de Juegos en Godot</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">Creamos juegos simples con el motor Godot, ideales para entretenimiento y educación.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <img src="/img/tech-team.jpg" alt="Nuestro Equipo" class="mt-10 rounded-xl shadow-xl w-full">
        <div class="text-center mt-8">
            <a href="/contacto" class="bg-[#8a38a1] text-white font-bold py-4 px-10 rounded-full text-lg hover:bg-[#722c85] hover:scale-105 transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg">
                Contáctanos
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

<footer class="mt-10 py-6 bg-gray-900 text-center text-white">
    <p class="text-lg">© 2025 APRASRANET. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
</footer>

<script>
    window.addEventListener('scroll', function() {
        var navbar = document.getElementById('navbar');
        if (window.scrollY > 50) {
            navbar.classList.add('shadow-lg', 'bg-opacity-100');
        } else {
            navbar.classList.remove('shadow-lg', 'bg-opacity-100');
        }
    });
</script>

</body>
</html>
